 "html": "<div class=\"body-container\"><div class=\"container-fluid\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-1 dnd_area-row-0-background-color dnd_area-row-0-force-full-width-section dnd_area-row-0-background-layers dnd-section dnd_area-row-0-padding\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span\">\n<div id=\"m-dnd_area-module-2\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-split hp-sec-split--flipped hp-sec-split--invert-cols hp--light hp--margin-t-0 hp--margin-b-0\">\n<div class=\"hp--relative\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid hp--clearfix hp--flip-container\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-split__left hp--relative\" style=\"background-color: rgba(25, 203, 228, 0.2); \">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-split__content hp--relative\" style=\"height:590px\"><span class=\"hp-sec__title-intro hp-sec__title-intro--left hp-sec-split__title-intro\">\n            Azoria Fiberglass Pools\n          </span><h1 class=\"hp-sec__title hp-heading-style--default hp-sec-split__title\">Elora</h1><span class=\"hp-rich-text hp-sec__desc hp-sec-split__desc\">\n<p>The Elora fiberglass plunge pool from Azoria’s Dolphin Collection is designed for ultimate relaxation and socializing. This compact, flat-bottom pool features dual side entry steps and ample bench seating, creating the perfect setting for cocktails, conversation, and cooling off in style.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Width:</strong> 12 ft 4 inch</li>\n<li><strong>Length:</strong> 17 ft 10 inch</li>\n<li><strong>Depth:</strong> 5 ft</li>\n<li><strong>Water Volume:</strong> 17, 676 L (4,670 gal)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Download The Spec Sheet Below For More Details &amp; Information</strong></p>\n</span><div class=\"hp-cta-container hp-sec-split__cta-container hp--clearfix\">\n<div class=\"hp--neg-margin-lr-10\"><div class=\"hp-cta-container__cta hp-sec-split__cta hp-cta hp-cta--primary-solid\">\n<a class=\"hp-cta_button\" href=\"/files/azoria-specs-eng-elora-12x18.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" role=\"button\" target=\"_blank\">Download Spec Sheet</a>\n</div><div class=\"hp-cta-container__cta hp-sec-split__cta hp-cta hp-cta--primary-solid\">\n<a class=\"hp-cta_button\" href=\"/en-ca/request-a-quote\" role=\"button\">Request A Quote</a>\n</div></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-sec-split__right\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-split__img hp-sec-split__img--mode-contain\" style=\"height:590px;background-color: rgba(25, 203, 228, 0.2);\">\n<img alt=\"DOLPHIN_Elora_1218_12x18_web\" class=\"hp-background-img\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/files/chub-backup/dolphin-elora-1218-12x18-web.webp\" style=\"object-fit: contain;object-position: top;\"/>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-2 dnd-section\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span dnd-column\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-3 dnd-row\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span widget_1762011976396-flexbox-positioning\">\n<div id=\"m-widget_1762011976396\">\n<span id=\"m-widget_1762011976396_\"><a href=\"https://www.azoria.ca/en/\" id=\"hs-link-widget_1762011976396_\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"border-width:0px;border:0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"azoria fiberglass pools\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/azoria-pools-windsor.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" title=\"azoria fiberglass pools\"/></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-4 dnd_area-row-2-force-full-width-section dnd_area-row-2-padding dnd-section\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span dnd-column\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-5 dnd-row\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span\">\n<div id=\"m-dnd_area-module-3\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-txt hp-sec-txt--2col hp-mh-group hp--light hp--sec-padding-t-sm hp--margin-t-0 hp--margin-b-0\">\n<div class=\"page-center hp--relative hp--clearfix\"><div class=\"hp-sec-txt__intro-sec hp-sec__intro-sec\"><h2 class=\"hp-sec__title hp-heading-style--default hp-sec__title--narrow hp-sec-txt__title\">Built-In Features</h2></div><div class=\"hp-sec-txt__content hp-sec-txt__content--top hp--clearfix\"><div class=\"hp-rich-text hp-sec-txt__left\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Integrated Bench Seating: </strong>including spacious bench along every side of the pool the Elora offers the perfect place to relax or cool off while socializing with friends &amp; family.</li>\n</ul>\n</div><div class=\"hp-rich-text hp-sec-txt__right\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Flat Bottom Design:</strong> A 5 foot deep flat bottom design offers plenty of space for plunging, while offering a depth suitable for socializing and relaxation </li>\n<li><strong>Dual Entry Steps:</strong> Gradual steps provide safe and comfortable access into the pool. The Elora has two sets of steps on each side of the pool.</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-6 dnd-section dnd_area-row-3-padding dnd_area-row-3-force-full-width-section\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span dnd-column\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-7 dnd-row\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span\">\n<div id=\"m-module_17620089498935\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-split hp-sec-split--flipped hp-sec-split--invert-cols hp--dark hp--margin-t-0 hp--margin-b-0\">\n<div class=\"hp--relative\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid hp--clearfix hp--flip-container\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-split__left hp--relative\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-split__content hp--relative\"><span class=\"hp-sec__title-intro hp-sec__title-intro--left hp-sec-split__title-intro\">\n            Azoria Brochure\n          </span><h3 class=\"hp-sec__title hp-heading-style--default hp-sec-split__title\">Discover the Azoria Collection Download Our Fiberglass Pool Brochure</h3><span class=\"hp-rich-text hp-sec__desc hp-sec-split__desc\">\n<p>Discover the beauty and craftsmanship behind the Azoria fiberglass pool line. Our brochure gives you an inside look at every model — from dimensions and color choices to the little design details that make Azoria pools such a favorite for modern backyards. Download your copy to see installation tips, customization options, and plenty of inspiration for creating your own outdoor retreat.</p>\n<p data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Each pool is built to last and designed to fit the way you live, combining smart engineering with a timeless sense of style. Whether you’re dreaming of peaceful mornings by the water or summer evenings spent with family and friends, an Azoria pool helps you turn your backyard into something truly special.</p>\n</span><div class=\"hp-cta-container hp-sec-split__cta-container hp--clearfix\">\n<div class=\"hp--neg-margin-lr-10\"><div class=\"hp-cta-container__cta hp-sec-split__cta hp-cta hp-cta--regular-border\">\n<a class=\"hp-cta_button\" href=\"/files/azoria-fiberglass-pools-brochure.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" role=\"button\" target=\"_blank\">Download The Brochure</a>\n</div></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-sec-split__right\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-split__img hp-sec-split__img--mode-cover\">\n<img alt=\"AZORIA_Brochure_Mockup_FR_low\" class=\"hp-background-img\" data-maxretina=\"1.5\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/azoria-brochure-mockup-fr-low.webp\" style=\"object-fit: cover;object-position: bottom;\"/>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-8 dnd-section dnd_area-row-4-background-layers dnd_area-row-4-force-full-width-section dnd_area-row-4-background-color dnd_area-row-4-padding\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span dnd-column\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-9 dnd-row\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span\">\n<div id=\"m-module_17620106077286\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-team hp--align-c hp--light hp--padding-t-0 hp--padding-b-0 hp--margin-t-0 hp--margin-b-0 hp-sec--shadow\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1.0); \">\n<div class=\"page-center hp--relative\"><div class=\"hp-sec-team__intro-sec hp-sec__intro-sec\"><h2 class=\"hp-sec__title hp-heading-style--default hp-sec__title--narrow hp-sec-team__title\">Stunning Color Finishes That Bring Your Azoria Fiberglass Pool to Life</h2><span class=\"hp-rich-text hp-sec__desc hp-sec-team__desc\">\n<p><span>Azoria fiberglass pools come in a range of gel-coat colour finishes that enhance both the water’s appearance and the pool’s overall aesthetic. Each color is designed to create a unique visual effect, from deep, rich tones that give a lagoon-like vibe to brighter hues that reflect light for a clean, sparkling look. The finishes are UV-resistant and engineered to maintain their vibrancy over time, even under harsh sunlight.<br/></span></p>\n</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"page-center hp--relative\">\n<div class=\"hp-team-members hp-mh-group-byRow hp--neg-margin-lr-10 hp--clearfix\"><div class=\"hp-team-member hp-team-member--style-reduced hp-team-member--circle\">\n<div class=\"hp--padding-b-md\">\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__img hp-team-member__img--style-reduced\">\n<img alt=\"Azoria Fiberglass Pools - Seal Salt Pool Finish\" class=\"hp-background-img\" data-maxretina=\"1.5\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/azoria-sea-salt-1.png\" style=\"object-fit: cover;\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__name\">Sea Salt</span>\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__job-title hp-team-member__job-title--style-reduced\">White Pool Surface Finish Cool Blue Water Colour</span></div><div class=\"hp-team-member hp-team-member--style-reduced hp-team-member--circle\">\n<div class=\"hp--p